   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Devastated by Osipenko's rumors that his grandfather was a wartime traitor, Ivan sits outside drinking with an acquaintance, pouring out his grief. Let's listen in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ну как так можно, а?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Для нас это святой праздник!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
