  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's walk through the conversation step by step. Distraught Samsonov drowns his sorrows over his family honour.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ну как так можно, а?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'How is that even possible, eh?' Samsonov shakes his head in disbelief over the allegations.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Для нас это святой праздник!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'For us that is a sacred holiday!' Notice the adjective meaning 'sacred' used with a masculine noun.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я всегда смотрел фильмы про войну.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I always watched movies about the war.' Samsonov recalls growing up on Soviet patriotic cinema.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Есть такая профессия — родину защищать!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'There is such a profession — defending the motherland!' Samsonov quotes the famous line from the classic Soviet movie 'Officers'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Как теперь с этим жить, а?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'How can one live with this now, eh?' Notice the infinitive construction expressing inability to cope.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "friend",
   "t": "Да, дела совсем плохие.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Yes, things are really bad.' The companion sympathizes with Ivan's awful situation.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "friend",
   "t": "Где ты был так долго?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Where were you for so long?' The companion asks where Ivan disappeared to.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Извини, у меня тяжёлая депрессия.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Sorry, I have severe depression.' Ivan explains his despair using a modern loanword.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "friend",
   "t": "Тогда сходи за новой бутылкой.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Then go get a new bottle.' Notice the preposition with the instrumental case denoting what to fetch.",
